OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786621676
OL,3,CNurses collapsing on shift in
OL,4,C'unbearably hot' hospitals during
OL,5,Cheatwave
OL,7,FNurses are collapsing at work while
OL,8,Fhaving to care for patients in
OL,9,Ftemperatures in excess of 30C, the
OL,10,FRoyal College of Nursing (RCN) has
OL,11,Fwarned.
OL,13,FOthers have reported seizures and
OL,14,F"dripping with sweat from head to toe"
OL,15,Fduring work, as the UK is on course
OL,16,Ffor its hottest summer on record.
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786621676
OL,3,CNurses collapsing on shift in
OL,4,C'unbearably hot' hospitals during
OL,5,Cheatwave
OL,7,FNurses have also expressed concern for
OL,8,Fthe welfare of patients being cared
OL,9,Ffor in hospitals, some of which have
OL,10,Fbeen described as "unbearably hot" and
OL,11,F"not fit for humans" during the
OL,12,Fheatwave.
OL,14,F"When nursing staff are collapsing,
OL,15,Ffeeling dizzy, sick or even being
OL,16,Fadmitted to the very hospitals they
OL,17,Fwork in because their workplaces
OL,18,Fcannot handle the heat, it shows just
OL,19,Fhow badly they are being failed," said
OL,20,FRCN chief executive and general
OL,21,Fsecretary Professor Nicola Ranger.
OL,26,@rD@SOUrD@bO]sD@AOUsD@TO]vD@AOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786621676
OL,3,CNurses collapsing on shift in
OL,4,C'unbearably hot' hospitals during
OL,5,Cheatwave
OL,7,FThe RCN has compiled a series of
OL,8,Ftestimonies to its advice line to
OL,9,Fpaint a picture of conditions facing
OL,10,Fnurses during heatwaves.
OL,12,FThese include:
OL,14,FProf Ranger said: "These testimonies
OL,15,Fshould be a wake-up call. Swathes of
OL,16,Fthe NHS and social care estate are in
OL,17,Fdisrepair following decades of
OL,18,Funderinvestment and are utterly
OL,19,Funprepared for extreme temperatures.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786621676
OL,3,CNurses collapsing on shift in
OL,4,C'unbearably hot' hospitals during
OL,5,Cheatwave
OL,7,F"It's becoming an impossible and
OL,8,Finhumane place to work or receive
OL,9,Fcare, with vulnerable patients,
OL,10,Fincluding the elderly and those
OL,11,Frecovering from surgery, receiving
OL,12,Fcare in temperatures that risk making
OL,13,Fthem sicker. It's unacceptable."
OL,15,FMatthew Hopkins, director of the NHS
OL,16,FAlliance ambulance and acute network,
OL,17,Fsaid NHS organisations were pushing
OL,18,Ffor increased funding from the
OL,19,Fgovernment to deal with maintenance of
OL,20,Fhospital buildings.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
