CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786621676
OL,3,CNurses collapsing on shift in
OL,4,C'unbearably hot' hospitals during
OL,5,Cheatwave
OL,7,FSpeaking on the NHS Alliance's Health
OL,8,Fon the Line podcast, he said: "I think
OL,9,Ffor a lot of our members that are
OL,10,Frunning hospitals that are very old
OL,11,Fand where infrastructure's really
OL,12,Funder pressure, many of those
OL,13,Fhospitals are carrying significant
OL,14,Flevels of backlog maintenance.
OL,16,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
