CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786621676
OL,3,CNurses collapsing on shift in
OL,4,C'unbearably hot' hospitals during
OL,5,Cheatwave
OL,7,F"Some of our members tell us that that
OL,8,Ftotals, in some cases, more than #100
OL,9,Fmillion worth of cost.
OL,11,F"And inevitably, the boards of those
OL,12,Forganisations will be regularly
OL,13,Fdiscussing and focusing on the risk
OL,14,Fmanagement associated with the trade-
OL,15,Foffs that they're going to have to be
OL,16,Fdealing with, you know, fixing a roof
OL,17,Fof a building to make it safe and
OL,18,Fwatertight for winter versus
OL,19,Finstalling air conditioning and
OL,20,Fpotentially the impact on the
OL,21,Felectrical infrastructure."
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
